  "scope": {
    "zh": "这是24项具体做法的原创自我观察。“时代”在这里是可自由采用的当前章节标题，不是六种普世发展阶段，不按年龄、人生事件或固定顺序派型，不评进度、成熟、成功、智慧、韧性、健康、关系质量或职业匹配。六组是编辑观察入口，可能同时出现；均分不证明心理独立、信效度、跨语言等价或任何人口常模，不指导辞职、财务、医疗或重大关系决定。",
    "en": "This is an original self-observation of twenty-four particular practices. Era is an optional title for a current chapter, not six universal developmental stages. It assigns no type by age, life event or fixed sequence and rates no progress, maturity, success, wisdom, resilience, health, relationship quality or career fit. Six groups are editorial observation entrances that may coexist. Means establish no psychological independence, reliability, validity, language equivalence or population norms, and guide no resignation, financial, medical or major relationship decision."
  },
  "instructions": {
    "zh": "回想过去四周，在有相关机会、自己也愿意的普通场面中，这种做法出现得多频繁。选择1—5频率；未经历、没有合适机会或无法判断选不适用，不补零。24项都选择后，六组分别计算有效频率均分，每组至少3项；所有六份全文始终开放，不加总、不按最高值派人生阶段。没有一项合适可以停止。",
    "en": "Recall how often each practice occurred over four weeks in ordinary, fitting situations with a relevant opportunity and your willingness. Choose a frequency from one to five. For no experience, no fitting opportunity or uncertainty, choose the unjudged option; it is not zero. All twenty-four items need a choice before six separate rated-frequency means, requiring three rated items per group. All six full guides remain available without a total or highest-value life-stage assignment. Stop if nothing fits."
  },
